  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "英文句構與翻譯(一)",
    "sub_ename": "ENGLISH SENTENCE STRUCTURES AND TRANSLATION (1)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程內容涵蓋英文句構與中英翻譯，旨在訓練學生習得大量的英文句構知識，以奠定學生提升英文寫作能力之根基。課程著重於句子合併練習及分析英文單字、片語與子句之結構。學生不僅需要練習所學之句型結構，更需要創造出淬鍊精確之句型寫作。學生並將藉由中英文法結構的不同，學習基本的句型翻譯方法與技巧。",
    "describe_eh": "This course covers English sentence structures and translation. It is primarily designed to allow students to gain a sufficient amount of grammar knowledge and then to provide them with the tools necessary for building their writing proficiency. Much emphasis will be placed on analyzing the structure of words, phrases and clauses as well as doing sentence combining exercises. Students are expected to produce a wide range of sophisticated grammatical expressions. Through comparing the different structures between Chinese and English, students will be able to learn basic Chinese-English translation skills.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
